{"turns":[{"text":"It's a very natural thing to do with people you are very close to.","zh":"和非常亲近的人这样做是很自然的事。","start":1009.9018,"end":1015.6},{"text":"Let's listen to this conversation.","zh":"我们来听听这段对话。","start":1018.3475,"end":1020.31},{"text":"Hey Sarah, do you have a second?","zh":"嘿，Sarah，你有空吗？","start":1020.6086250000001,"end":1022.639},{"text":"Yeah.","zh":"嗯。","start":1023.7589375000001,"end":1023.8833750000001},{"text":"What's up?","zh":"怎么了？","start":1023.8833750000001,"end":1024.13225},{"text":"You look a little stressed.","zh":"你看起来有点紧张。","start":1024.13225,"end":1025.52},{"text":"I am.","zh":"是啊。","start":1026.2198461538462,"end":1026.9196923076922},{"text":"Um, I have a big favor to ask.","zh":"嗯，我想请你帮个大忙。","start":1026.9196923076922,"end":1029.7190769230767}],"lessonTurns":[{"text":"It's a very natural thing to do with people you are very close to.","zh":"和非常亲近的人这样做是很自然的事。","start":1009.9018,"end":1015.6},{"text":"Let's listen to this conversation.","zh":"我们来听听这段对话。","start":1018.3475,"end":1020.31},{"text":"Hey Sarah, do you have a second?","zh":"嘿，Sarah，你有空吗？","start":1020.6086250000001,"end":1022.639},{"text":"Yeah.","zh":"嗯。","start":1023.7589375000001,"end":1023.8833750000001},{"text":"What's up?","zh":"怎么了？","start":1023.8833750000001,"end":1024.13225},{"text":"You look a little stressed.","zh":"你看起来有点紧张。","start":1024.13225,"end":1025.52},{"text":"I am.","zh":"是啊。","start":1026.2198461538462,"end":1026.9196923076922},{"text":"Um, I have a big favor to ask.","zh":"嗯，我想请你帮个大忙。","start":1026.9196923076922,"end":1029.7190769230767}]}